            <ArticleTitle>Poisson-type inequalities for growth properties of positive superharmonic functions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1186/s13660-016-1278-7</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper, we present new Poisson-type inequalities for Poisson integrals with continuous data on the boundary. The obtained inequalities are used to obtain growth properties at infinity of positive superharmonic functions in a smooth cone.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
